ys 1.0 Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ssot2OjxEGw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 191691, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "lLRp6flgZFc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lLRp6flgZFc", "title": "Malys Official Teaser | The ANZ Indie Showcase 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lLRp6flgZFc/hqdefault.jpg"}]}